ENTRY            31874   20260608   20261124   20261124       3224
SUBENT        31874001   20260608   20261124   20261124       3224
BIB                 11         19
TITLE      Measurement of neutron capture cross section of the
            165Ho(n,gamma)166Ho reaction at 0.0372 eV energy
AUTHOR     (A.Dib, N.Belouadah, N.Osmani)
INSTITUTE  (3ALGUHB,3ALGRNB)
REFERENCE  (J,RCA,114,247,2026)
           #doi:10.1515/ract-2025-0088
FACILITY   (REAC,3ALGRNB) Es-Salam Research Reactor
SAMPLE     A powder sample of holmium oxide (Ho2O3) (99% purity)
            was pressed into a pellet (1.12 g, 1.2 cm diameter)
            under 5 ton/cm2 pressure. It was placed
            between two gold foils (25 um thick, 10 mm diameter,
            99% pure) used for neutron flux monitoring.
DETECTOR   (HPGE) Detector with a resolution of 1.80 keV at
            1,332.5 keV (60Co) and 0.89 keV for 122 keV (57Co).
METHOD     (FNB) Pb(200) single crystal
           (ACTIV) Irradiated for 7 h
CORRECTION Corrected for gamma-ray attenuation and geometry
STATUS     (TABLE,,A.Dib+,J,RCA,114,247,2026) Table 4
HISTORY    (20260608C) VT
ENDBIB              19
NOCOMMON             0          0
ENDSUBENT           22
SUBENT        31874002   20260608   20261124   20261124       3224
BIB                  6         15
REACTION   (67-HO-165(N,G)67-HO-166-G,,SIG)
SAMPLE     (67-HO-166,ENR=0.99)
DECAY-DATA (67-HO-166-G,26.82HR,DG,80.57,0.0660,
                                DG,1379.43,0.0090)
MONITOR    (79-AU-197(N,G)79-AU-198,,SIG)
DECAY-MON  (79-AU-198-G,2.695D,DG,411.80,0.9550)
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-T) Total uncertainties      (~5.14%)
           (ERR-S) Statistical uncertainty  (1.2%)
           (ERR-1) Decay branching ratio    (0.03%)
           (ERR-2) Half-life                (0.07%)
           (ERR-3) Efficiency calibration   (3%)
           (ERR-4) Sample mass              (0.06%)
           (ERR-5) Self-shielding factor    (0.01%)
           (ERR-6) Neutron flux, including Au monitor cross
            section uncertainty (+/-2 b) corresponds to (4%)
ENDBIB              15
COMMON               6          3
ERR-1      ERR-2      ERR-3      ERR-4      ERR-5      ERR-6
PER-CENT   PER-CENT   PER-CENT   PER-CENT   PER-CENT   PER-CENT
       0.03       0.07         3.       0.06       0.01         4.
ENDCOMMON            3
DATA                 5          1
EN         DATA       ERR-T      ERR-S      MONIT
EV         B          B          PER-CENT   B
     0.0372      52.71        2.7        1.2      81.45
